/*
 * Declares the TemplateRefType class.
 *
 * A TemplateRefType is a temporary placeholder used during semantic validation
 * to refer to a template symbol. It does not represent a concrete type and is
 * never emitted into YIL. Its sole purpose is to carry a reference to a
 * TemplateSymbol from the symbol table until the template is instantiated or
 * resolved.
 *
 * This type appears in intermediate stages of validation when the structure of
 * a template is known but its parameters or instantiation context are not yet
 * fully determined.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::temporary::templateref
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/temporary/templateref.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-11-20
